- On mobile/compatible browsers → triggers the native **Web Share sheet** (shares the pin URL + title)
- On desktop → **copies the pin URL to clipboard** with a brief "Copied!" confirmation, so you can paste it anywhere instantly

### ⬇️ Download Button (Pinterest red)
- Shows a **download icon + "Download" label**
- **Instantly downloads the pin image** to your device using the image's source URL, named after the pin's description (e.g., `a-small-white-and-brown-cat-sit.jpg`)
- Briefly shows "Saving…" feedback while the download initiates

### Design details:
- Buttons have **hover states**, **rounded pill shape**, and **smooth transitions**
- The bar has a **subtle top border** and **rounded bottom corners** to blend neatly with each card
- Rule is **idempotent** — new pin cards loaded on scroll automatically get the buttons too

